  "prewrite_review": "An initial unexecuted scope draft listed task-integrity logs but omitted the document-checks stdout/stderr names used by four call matrices. The read-only classification assertion caught those eight records before writing any scope claim. Inspecting every missing basename confirms only auxiliary gate logs; include both documented gate naming forms.",
