  "scope": "The original preservation census also includes auxiliary book/claim/commit/task/document-gate logs. Their exact before/after fingerprint records are retained, but their bodies are not tracked recovery inputs. Revalidate those recorded relationships only, without claiming fresh raw-byte rereads of every old object. Every declared qualification/replay seed body remains tracked. This is an evidence boundary, not a demonstrated archive or replay defect.",
